If you want it back the way it was, use **Edit > Undo**.

Look at the keys at 0.5 s and 1.5 s in Title's Position. They've changed from diamonds to hourglasses. Scrub through and you'll see the move now slows as it leaves the first key and slows again as it arrives at the next.

